Builds the measured bounded-pilot evidence required by the merged `US_FULL_CORPUS_CAPACITY_PROJECTION_V1` gate.

- requires explicit `-Apply` and exactly one deterministic US Application package;
- requires clean checkout, persistent worker stopped, PostgreSQL/ClickHouse running;
- freezes the existing replay dry-run next step before mutation;
- takes read-only pre/post storage profiles and CN serving checkpoints;
- derives raw bytes from the exact preflight source identity;
- measures Hot bytes/rows from active `system.parts` pre/post deltas only for the exact `app.us.ingest.OUTPUT_PACKAGE_COLUMNS` table contract;
- blocks on negative deltas or any unrelated US table change;
- records Warm bytes as `0` only because the current US Application ingest moves the same source file to raw archive and creates no separate Warm representation;
- emits `US_BOUNDED_CAPACITY_PILOT_RECEIPT_V1` ready to feed the full-corpus projection gate.

No full-corpus replay, no `-All`, no US clean rebuild, no persistent worker lifecycle change, and no CN mutation are authorized by this PR.

