Tracks #206 and supersedes only the presentation concerns documented in #38.

## Included

- repository implementation brief and native-frontend architecture decision;
- schema-validated registry for the six approved appearances:
  - Warm Studio
  - Midnight & Saffron / Tinted Signal
  - Aubergine & Aqua / Tinted Signal
  - Midnight Dark
  - Aubergine Dark
  - Weyland
