- synchronous pre-paint profile restoration, safe fallback, local persistence, cross-tab synchronization, browser chrome ownership, and Appearance controls;
- fixed ten-domain desktop sidebar and connected global header;
- accessible mobile drawer with inert state, focus trap/return, Escape, backdrop, scroll lock, and 44px targets;
- active navigation marker + shape + weight + `aria-current`; Product maps to Products;
