## Invariants preserved

- all 11 route URLs and page runtime owners;
- Sales/Catalog analytical URL and browser-history behavior;
- Home API, metric bases, Ads state, data-health contract, inventory action semantics and chart inputs;
- asset-release/build footer contract;
- one shell owner, one page style owner, one page runtime owner;
- no React/Vite/TypeScript or second frontend runtime.

## Verification policy

This PR is the first full application-quality run for the assembled block. Development commits intentionally did not dispatch duplicate full CI chains.

After merge/deploy:

- require the exact merged SHA in production;
- require deployment QA success;
- run standalone DPP Playwright using Chromium desktop, Pixel 5 mobile, WebKit desktop and iPhone 12 mobile;
- verify navigation, appearance persistence, Business interactions, overflow, console/network health, asset revision, and footer SHA;
- record production evidence on #206 before the next block.

